{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/44924b50aaa3279d7a04c67f063b69fe.avif?t=1760443623\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras_big/44924b50aaa3279d7a04c67f063b69fe.avif?t=1760443623 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Explore eerie levels filled with a variety of puzzles that fully capture the liminality and unsettling atmosphere true to the Backrooms lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(More levels will be added throughout the early access period.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/5c26bac4260b2276f8d5eb87d4cb11ff.avif?t=1760443623\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras_big/5c26bac4260b2276f8d5eb87d4cb11ff.avif?t=1760443623 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Immerse yourself in the true Backrooms experience, whether alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Proximity chat adapts to the environment, ensuring the most immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras/a4951a6409589905a86e764a1e668bc2.avif?t=1760443623\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546790/extras_big/a4951a6409589905a86e764a1e668bc2.avif?t=1760443623 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the most authentic Backrooms experience with: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022